expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Generates an independently publishable runtime plugin with an echo method

Usage: leptoskit generate plugin [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Destination directory

Options:
      --name <NAME>                Plugin name, otherwise taken from the directory
      --bridge-path <BRIDGE_PATH>  Local `leptoskit_bridge` crate for SDK development before publication
  -h, --help                       Print help
  -V, --version                    Print version
